Hmm, useNavigation from expo-router returns the nearest navigation prop. Inside header, the component is rendered within the navigator so it should be the drawer navigation. Actually, react-navigation's DrawerToggleButton uses useNavigation and works in headerLeft. Let me use the same. But TypeScript: useNavigation<DrawerNavigationProp>() — the type from expo-router/drawer exports DrawerNavigationProp. openDrawer is a method.

